#: source/release-notes/rl-2.22.md:1
msgid "Release 2.22.0 (2024-04-23)"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.22.md:3
msgid "Significant changes"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.22.md:5
msgid ""
"Remove experimental repl-flake [\\#10103](https://github.com/NixOS/nix/"
"issues/10103) [\\#10299](https://github.com/NixOS/nix/pull/10299)"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.22.md:7
msgid ""
"The `repl-flake` experimental feature has been removed. The `nix repl` "
"command now works like the rest of the new CLI in that `nix repl {path}` now "
"tries to load a flake at `{path}` (or fails if the `flakes` experimental "
"feature isn't enabled)."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.22.md:9
msgid "Other changes"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.22.md:11
msgid ""
"`nix eval` prints derivations as `.drv` paths [\\#10200](https://github.com/"
"NixOS/nix/pull/10200)"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.22.md:13
msgid ""
"`nix eval` will now print derivations as their `.drv` paths, rather than as "
"attribute sets. This makes commands like `nix eval nixpkgs#bash` terminate "
"instead of infinitely looping into recursive self-referential attributes:"
msgstr ""
